ock;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6b56488e-a637-4d82-a84b-dae5d8ed7c39.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"260\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">На этот:</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_432dec7c-dc40-490e-8859-74b01f0c9296.png\" width=\"358\" height=\"260\"></p>",
